QMBiE2q" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/44df7612f8b3831e6c6a7e7182ecdb56d816251c.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;进山先采野棉花，抬眼望山辨金芽，寻金古法传万家，棕树剖开取芯渣，捶揉淘淀出粉花，野棉配粉和面粑，荒野炊香乐无涯。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b5QMBiE2q</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b5QMBiE2q</guid><pubDate>Sat, 11 Apr 2026 09:40:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>《荒野食神》武陵篇3</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116371920913466&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1tGDnBYESR" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fd256d07d2844b5c9729e3f14e66303059876a03.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;第三章溪间寻鱼，草木成酸：隔夜老鳖当早餐，松油艾草制火燃。徒步十里寻山鲜，虎杖酸香竹笋甜。扎营歇脚麻柳边，围坝晕鱼起波澜。一锅酸菜山野味，荒野求生赛神仙。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tGDnBYESR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tGDnBYESR</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Apr 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>《荒野食神》武陵篇2</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116362206775027&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1LBDaB5EdS" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cf8176764d56f52e190aa24d7bb957b636ef95b9.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;开始稳定，两天一更。速降下谷底，拾竹备材料。冒雨向前行，扎寨把营安，装备样样全，钓鳖做美餐！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LBDaB5EdS</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LBDaB5EdS</guid><pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 09:40:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>《荒野食神》武陵篇1</title><descrip