海岛求生终上岸。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1krPfzPE1S</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1krPfzPE1S</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（19）</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116191901322366&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1dYNuzJEpf" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4527dfd471ae084d037b171ff119dbe0d9dbd2d3.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;日夜颠倒，夜出觅食；多日坚守，终等天时；真实模拟，海岛求生。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dYNuzJEpf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dYNuzJEpf</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（18）</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116180140492365&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1pEPWzAEJZ" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1f6d822843be419d146d19b09d590e9d64870794.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;模拟真实海岛求生，十余天坚守，不负有心人，终退大潮，海鲜满载，生蚝鲜美，海鲜大餐。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pEPWzAEJZ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pEPWzAEJZ</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item></channel></rss>